# Never commit game files or binaries — this project stores only files we create.
# Game executables, assets, and archives
*.exe
*.dll
*.bin
# id Tech engine package/asset formats (original game content)
*.resources
*.entities
*.decl
# Extracted or dumped memory / process data
*.dmp
*.dump
*.raw
# Local scratch
/tmp/
*.log

# ...but recon evidence logs are DERIVED DATA, not scratch run logs. The blanket
# `*.log` above silently swallowed all nine logs under
# recon/2026-08-31-first-live-run/ - including run3-camera-found.log and
# run12-bisect.log, the evidence behind the camera isolation. A session copied
# them in believing they were saved; `git add` skipped them without complaint and
# they stayed single-disk files. The same defect was found the same day in
# the-evil-within-vr and enslaved-vr. Negate the rule for recon/.
!dev-archive/recon/**/*.log
!recon/**/*.log
